        "collapsible_tab_desc": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is it?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>CoolBro is a daily intimate wash built specifically for men. It is made for the groin, inner thighs and everywhere that traps heat and sweat, using a gentle pH matched formula that keeps you clean, cool and fresh without the dryness and irritation regular body wash leaves behind.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_why": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why CoolBro exists",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Women have had dedicated intimate care for decades. Most men have been using the same harsh three in one body wash since university and wondering why they never feel properly fresh. CoolBro exists to fix that, in one simple step in the shower.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_benefits": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key benefits",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Neutralises odor instead of masking it</li><li>pH matched for intimate skin</li><li>Cooling freshness that lasts all day</li><li>Deep cleans sweat and buildup</li><li>Helps reduce dryness and irritation</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_use": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>In the shower, once a day. Lather a small amount over the groin, inner thighs and anywhere that traps heat, leave it for 30 to 60 seconds, then rinse well and pat dry. Use daily for lasting freshness.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_guarantee": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Powered by menthol for cooling, zinc ricinoleate for real odor control, ceramides and glycerin to lock in moisture, fermented probiotics to protect your skin’s natural balance, and a soothing aloe, bamboo and moringa complex. Free from sulphates, parabens, silicones and artificial colours.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
