    "collapsible_content_vr": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will my girlfriend notice?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>In the best way. Most men say the first thing a partner notices is that they smell clean and fresh, not heavily fragranced. It reads as natural, just better.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does the cooling feel like?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Fresh, not freezing. A light menthol cool that signals clean and settles into all day comfort. Refreshing in summer, never harsh.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it safe for sensitive skin?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It is built for it. pH matched, free from sulphates, parabens and silicones, and packed with soothing actives like aloe and ceramides. Gentle enough for daily use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is CoolBro?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>A daily intimate wash made specifically for men, for the groin, inner thighs and anywhere that traps heat and sweat. One gentle, pH matched step that keeps you clean, cool and fresh.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why not just use regular body wash?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Regular soap runs at pH 9 to 11 and is built to scrub, not to care for intimate skin at pH 5 to 6. Over time it strips the barrier, which is what brings back dryness, itch and odor. CoolBro cleans without the collateral damage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it actually help with odor?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, at the source. Zinc ricinoleate neutralises odor molecules instead of masking them, so freshness lasts well beyond the shower.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes CoolBro different?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It is made specifically for below the belt: a pH matched formula, real odor control, a soothing complex and a cooling finish in one daily step. Not a general three in one with a new label.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use it every day?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>That is the idea. The gentle, pH matched formula is designed for daily use. The more consistent you are, the fresher and more balanced your skin stays.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
